 payout controls

Same-owner test-only addition after EXACT official0009-209; source cac80270f4d1ebdb8b0fb709c62ce1ab70f4c869. Official0008 already matches Fminer bytes; no extra miner adapter. No production/serializer/canonicalizer edit.
